<title>RUSSIA: Russia to sell 22 pct of Yeniseineftegaz.</title>
<headline>Russia to sell 22 pct of Yeniseineftegaz.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia will sell 22 percent of AO Yeniseineftegaz oil company at an auction running from September 11 to October 11, a Federal Securities Corporation official said on Monday.</p>
<p>Yeniseineftegaz, formerly called Yeniseineftegazgeologiya, is one of the exploration units of East-Siberian Oil &amp; Gas Company.</p>
<p>Yeniseineftegaz shares with a face value of 1,000 roubles will have a starting price of 50,000 roubles.</p>
<p>Yeniseineftegaz's charter capital is 381.12 million roubles.</p>
<p>--Aleksandras Budrys, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
